      "id": "3hnq1fw",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "1. Battle of Hydaspes (326 BCE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Background: Alexander invaded north-western India after defeating Persia. King Porus ruled the region between Jhelum and Chenab.",
      "id": "ssxxuig"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Course: Alexander used strategic river crossing during monsoon to surprise Porus.",
      "id": "vdsinot"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Result: Alexander victorious but reinstated Porus as subordinate ruler.",
      "id": "8d0vg3t"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Impact: Beginning of Indo-Greek contacts and Hellenistic influence.",
      "id": "k5xtera"
    },
    {
      "id": "x2jjq3g",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "2. Kalinga War (261 BCE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Between Emperor Ashoka and the state of Kalinga.",
      "id": "llxxqm4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Result: Mauryan victory with massive casualties.",
      "id": "2eak7qy"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Impact: Ashoka embraced Buddhism and adopted policy of Dhamma; ended aggressive expansion.",
      "id": "9wezcfc"
    },
    {
      "id": "yanqgqt",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "PART II — MEDIEVAL INDIA"
    },
    {
      "id": "avrn93l",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "3. First & Second Battles of Tarain (1191–1192)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1191: Prithviraj Chauhan defeated Muhammad Ghori.",
      "id": "3v3snwm"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1192: Ghori returned and defeated Prithviraj.",
      "id": "g6pvelc"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Impact: Foundation of Delhi Sultanate in India.",
      "id": "8ba2qbj"
    },
    {
      "id": "hot8hkx",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "4. Battle of Chandawar (1194)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Muhammad Ghori defeated Jaichand of Kannauj, consolidating Turkish power in North India.",
      "id": "5joh5jo"
    },
    {
      "id": "i76vvsw",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "5. First Battle of Panipat (1526)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Between Babur and Ibrahim Lodi.",
      "id": "gosyz5h"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Babur used artillery and Tulughma tactics.",
      "id": "5kxdnwd"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "Babur used artillery and Tulughma tactics.",
      "id": "ghf5061"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Impact: Beginning of Mughal Empire in India.",
      "id": "fjoijue"
    },
    {
      "id": "oeiaioj",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "6. Battle of Khanwa (1527)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Babur defeated Rana Sanga.",
      "id": "zk1liz5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Consolidated Mughal power in North India.",
      "id": "3bny68w"
    },
    {
      "id": "ft0t2sc",
