      "level": 3,
      "content": "7. Battle of Haldighati (1576)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Between Akbar’s forces (Man Singh) and Maharana Pratap.",
      "id": "bkvbsjl"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Mughal tactical victory but Mewar resistance continued.",
      "id": "yisvt2o"
    },
    {
