      "content": "Between Vijayanagar Empire and Deccan Sultanates.",
      "id": "qcesxiu"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Result: Vijayanagar defeat; decline of the empire in South India.",
      "id": "chiuepw"
    },
